{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience authentic drone tactical operations! In this immersive military simulation game, you will play as a professional drone operator, executing critical reconnaissance and strike missions. Through a sophisticated drone control system, accomplish diverse tactical objectives\u2014from battlefield reconnaissance to precision strikes\u2014each mission will test your operational skills and tactical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command advanced reconnaissance/attack drones to execute key military operations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver through complex terrains: village ruins, forests, industrial areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face realistic tactical challenges: wind interference, enemy fire, terrain obstacles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a complete military operation, progressing from simple battle damage assessment to complex multi-phase strike missions, gradually enhancing your drone operation skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ideal for:</strong> Military simulation enthusiasts, tactical game players, hardcore simulation fans</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997110?t=1760009178","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/ca3d6a4fabeeb5fd960fcfc63f0b57280739eb8a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760009178","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/fb6edbd660d626edb1038bb4495e073fafff06b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760009178","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/fb6edbd660d626edb1038bb4495e073fafff06b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760009178","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content